Package: local.duobar.rootless
Name: DuoBar (Rootless)
Version: 2.7.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: DuoBar circular battery, Wi-Fi and cellular indicator for iOS 16 Rootless.
 Includes compact 5G/LTE text, a live adjustable 70%-140% size slider, Settings
 integration, charging and Low Power Mode colors, and Control Center improvements.
 For standard Rootless jailbreaks on iOS 16 (Dopamine, palera1n). The tweak and
 Settings executable include arm64 and arm64e slices.
Maintainer: RBx9
Author: RBx9
Homepage: https://github.com/RBx9/DuoBar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Conflicts: local.duobar
Tag: role::tweak
